{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14062","headline":"许下书情寄张韩二舍人 · 耿湋","name":"许下书情寄张韩二舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪宦军城老更悲，近来频夜梦丹墀。\n银杯乍灭心中火，金镊唯多鬓上丝。\n绕院绿苔闻雁处，满庭黄叶闭门时。\n故人高步云衢上，肯念前程杳未期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}